      "body": "@ko3n1g Do we care about all failures in merge queue?  Originally when this was running on a schedule, it was largely unnecessary because the merge queue guards against unwanted failures.  Unlike other repos that do not do merge queues, MLM maybe does not need an alert unless we want one for flaky tests or infra failures, which is a different and larger challenge.",
